{"comment_text": {"ja49:0.1": "", "ja49:0.2": "", "ja49:0.3": "", "ja49:0.4": "", "ja49:1.1": "A family reneges on its marriage date when told it falls under an unlucky constellation, so the girl marries someone else. ", "ja49:1.2": "", "ja49:1.3": "", "ja49:1.4": "Compare “what do the hymns matter?” at <a href='https://suttacentral.net/dn4/en/sujato#15.5'>DN 4:15.5</a>. ", "ja49:2.1": ""}, "html_text": {"ja49:0.1": "<article id='ja49'><header><ul><li class='division'>{}</li>", "ja49:0.2": "<li>{}</li>", "ja49:0.3": "<li>{}</li></ul>", "ja49:0.4": "<h1 class='sutta-title'>{}</h1></header>", "ja49:1.1": "<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja49:1.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja49:1.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja49:1.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja49:2.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja49:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja49:0.2": "Ekakanipāta ", "ja49:0.3": "Atthakāmavagga ", "ja49:0.4": "9. Nakkhattajātaka ", "ja49:1.1": "Nakkhattaṁ paṭimānentaṁ, ", "ja49:1.2": "attho bālaṁ upaccagā; ", "ja49:1.3": "Attho atthassa nakkhattaṁ, ", "ja49:1.4": "kiṁ karissanti tārakā”ti. ", "ja49:2.1": "Nakkhattajātakaṁ navamaṁ. "}, "translation_text": {"ja49:0.1": "Stories of Past Lives 49 ", "ja49:0.2": "The Book of the Ones ", "ja49:0.3": "Wanting to Help ", "ja49:0.4": "Constellations: a past life story ", "ja49:1.1": "Waiting for a constellation, ", "ja49:1.2": "a fool lets the good pass them by. ", "ja49:1.3": "The good is the constellation of the good; ", "ja49:1.4": "for what do the stars matter? ", "ja49:2.1": ""}, "reference_text": {"ja49:0.1": "", "ja49:0.2": "", "ja49:0.3": "", "ja49:0.4": "", "ja49:1.1": "ms22J_106, msdiv49, pts-vp-pli1.258, vri68.12", "ja49:1.2": "", "ja49:1.3": "", "ja49:1.4": "", "ja49:2.1": "ms22J_107"}, "keys_order": ["ja49:0.1", "ja49:0.2", "ja49:0.3", "ja49:0.4", "ja49:1.1", "ja49:1.2", "ja49:1.3", "ja49:1.4", "ja49:2.1"]}